          "overview": "A River Runs in Me is a stop motion film that follows Jaci, a woman who, crossed by deep pain, begins a journey in search of herself. Among landscapes where dreams, memory and reality intertwine, she seeks in her ancestry and in the reunion with her inner child a possible path to healing.",
